<title>CHINA: Shanghai Stock Exchange closed for holiday.</title>
<headline>Shanghai Stock Exchange closed for holiday.</headline>
<dateline>SHANGHAI 1997-02-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Shanghai Stock Exchange is closed for two weeks, starting on Monday, for the lunar new year holiday.</p>
<p>Trading will resume on Monday, February 17.</p>
<p>On Jan 31, Shanghai's B share index closed up 1.62 percent to 66.849 points. The A share index ended up 0.44 percent to 1,006.362 points.</p>
</text>
